package Physics.Tests

use Libraries.Game.Collision.LocalCollisionPoints3D

/*
A box 0.11 above the surface, past the contact threshold, gets nothing.

Unless a test says otherwise, the triangle is a large one lying flat
at height 0, from MakeLargeTriangle, with the usual margin of 0.04, so
its thickened surface is at 0.04. The box is 0.5 on each side for
collisions (see RunBox), with no rotation, and the triangle is item A.
A box whose center is at 0.28 has its bottom at 0.03, so it sinks 0.01
into the surface.
*/
class BoxTriangleOutOfReachTest is PhysicsTest
    on create
        SetName("Box and triangle: out of reach")
    end

    action Run
        LocalCollisionPoints3D points = RunBox(MakeLargeTriangle(0.04), MakeTransform(0, 0.4, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0), false)
        CheckWhole("box out of reach", points:GetPointCount(), 0)
    end
end
